# A program that spins cannot hold the machine: Ctrl+Break restarts it.
program: shell
keys: spin\n{wait 5}{ctrl-break}
---
rx286, test build
rx286 shell: type help for the commands
rx286> spin
Spinning; Ctrl+Break gets the shell back.
rx286: Ctrl+Break: the program starts again
rx286 shell, started again
rx286>
